cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use judgeledger in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "judgeledger: a local ledger of analytic judgments with locked resolution criteria"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that records analytic judgments with their resolution criteria locked before
  the fact, chains every action into an append-only hash log, requires a cited source to resolve an
  entry, and scores the declared probability intervals with the CRPS.
type: software
